  <data name="AboutTextFirst" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>ACT Global Technology is an engineering company that has adopted the basic principle of dispersed, advanced and quality production of vehicle air conditioning pipes. We offer high standard solutions at every stage of production with machining, pipe shaping, welding, assembly, test/control and external process services. We aim to exceed customer expectations with our modern technology-based production infrastructure and our customers.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutTextSecond" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Thanks to our experience in the sector, our commitment to quality and our process-oriented approach, we are positioned as a reliable solution partner in both domestic and international markets. As ACT Global Machine, we add value to our customers with a sustainable production approach and continuous improvement principles, and offer a competitive production power on a global scale.</value>
  </data>
