  <data name="ECS32TitleShortText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This machine is a special equipment for crimping rubber pipes, aluminum pipes and iron pipes.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ECS32TitleText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This machine is a special equipment for crimping rubber pipes, aluminum pipes and iron pipes. The maximum outer diameter of products that can be crimped is( Ф 32mm 1.25 ). The servo motor drives the lead screw for crimping through the drive mechanism, and the pressure sensor loaded at the front of the drive part controls and manages the drive pressure, which is energy-saving, environment-friendly, quiet and quickly.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="EfmMachineText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This equipment is an integrated pipe processing machine, integrating extrusion and chamfering forming functions. It is controlled by servo motors and ball screws for workstation switching, featuring strong power and precise positioning. It supports manual loading. One operation can complete the entire cycle of actions, and it can process both inner and outer angles as well as flat ends simultaneously.</value>
  </data>
